{"id":"c6e4ae351b7d8b03","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-simplicial-operators.md","title":"Definition — 面映射、退化映射与单纯恒等式","display":"Definition — 面映射、退化映射与单纯恒等式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-simplicial-operators","aliases":["14-df-simplicial-operators"],"display":"Definition — 面映射、退化映射与单纯恒等式","source_ref":"I.1; VIII.7, pp.450–452","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-simplicial-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-simplicial-operators"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-simplicial-operators</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 面映射、退化映射与单纯恒等式"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.1; VIII.7, pp.450–452"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"43500a42511700ce\" href=\"?note=43500a42511700ce\" title=\"14-df-simplicial-set\">14-df-simplicial-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"43500a42511700ce\" href=\"?note=43500a42511700ce\" title=\"14-df-simplicial-set\">14-df-simplicial-set</a> 的单纯集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n=S([n])\">\\(S_n=S([n])\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,i,j,k\">\\(n,i,j,k\\)</span> 均取外部自然数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_i^n:[n-1]\\to[n]\">\\(\\delta_i^n:[n-1]\\to[n]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_i^n:[n+1]\\to[n]\">\\(\\sigma_i^n:[n+1]\\to[n]\\)</span> 以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_i^n,s_i^n\">\\(d_i^n,s_i^n\\)</span> 在下式的明确指标域中定义；复合使用通常从右向左的次序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall i\\in[n]\\quad\n\\delta_i^n:=\\left([n-1],[n],\\left(k\\mapsto\\begin{cases}k&amp;k&lt;i,\\\\k+1&amp;k\\ge i\\end{cases}\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall i\\in[n]\\quad\n\\sigma_i^n:=\\left([n+1],[n],\\left(k\\mapsto\\begin{cases}k&amp;k\\le i,\\\\k-1&amp;k&gt;i\\end{cases}\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall i\\in[n]\\quad d_i^n:=S(\\delta_i^n):S_n\\to S_{n-1},\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall i\\in[n]\\quad s_i^n:=S(\\sigma_i^n):S_n\\to S_{n+1},\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\ \\forall i,j\\in[n]\\quad\ni&lt;j\\Rightarrow d_i^{n-1}\\circ d_j^n=d_{j-1}^{n-1}\\circ d_i^n,\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall i,j\\in[n]\\quad\ni\\le j\\Rightarrow s_i^{n+1}\\circ s_j^n=s_{j+1}^{n+1}\\circ s_i^n,\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall j\\in[n]\\ \\forall i\\in[n+1]\\quad\ni&lt;j\\Rightarrow d_i^{n+1}\\circ s_j^n=s_{j-1}^{n-1}\\circ d_i^n,\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall j\\in[n]\\quad\nd_j^{n+1}\\circ s_j^n=1_{S_n}=d_{j+1}^{n+1}\\circ s_j^n,\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall j\\in[n]\\ \\forall i\\in[n+1]\\quad\ni&gt;j+1\\Rightarrow d_i^{n+1}\\circ s_j^n=s_j^{n-1}\\circ d_{i-1}^n.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall i\\in[n]\\quad\n\\delta_i^n:=\\left([n-1],[n],\\left(k\\mapsto\\begin{cases}k&amp;k&lt;i,\\\\k+1&amp;k\\ge i\\end{cases}\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall i\\in[n]\\quad\n\\sigma_i^n:=\\left([n+1],[n],\\left(k\\mapsto\\begin{cases}k&amp;k\\le i,\\\\k-1&amp;k&gt;i\\end{cases}\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall i\\in[n]\\quad d_i^n:=S(\\delta_i^n):S_n\\to S_{n-1},\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall i\\in[n]\\quad s_i^n:=S(\\sigma_i^n):S_n\\to S_{n+1},\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\ \\forall i,j\\in[n]\\quad\ni&lt;j\\Rightarrow d_i^{n-1}\\circ d_j^n=d_{j-1}^{n-1}\\circ d_i^n,\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall i,j\\in[n]\\quad\ni\\le j\\Rightarrow s_i^{n+1}\\circ s_j^n=s_{j+1}^{n+1}\\circ s_i^n,\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall j\\in[n]\\ \\forall i\\in[n+1]\\quad\ni&lt;j\\Rightarrow d_i^{n+1}\\circ s_j^n=s_{j-1}^{n-1}\\circ d_i^n,\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall j\\in[n]\\quad\nd_j^{n+1}\\circ s_j^n=1_{S_n}=d_{j+1}^{n+1}\\circ s_j^n,\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall j\\in[n]\\ \\forall i\\in[n+1]\\quad\ni&gt;j+1\\Rightarrow d_i^{n+1}\\circ s_j^n=s_j^{n-1}\\circ d_{i-1}^n.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>面与退化的定义给出合法弱递增函数。逐整数计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta,\\sigma\">\\(\\delta,\\sigma\\)</span> 的复合后，施以反变函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，即得所列恒等式；反变性是复合次序反转的来源。这些关系保证交替面算子组成的边界满足平方为零，是原书联系单纯集合和同调的入口。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.1; VIII.7, pp.450–452。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-simplicial-set","status":"resolved","id":"43500a42511700ce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-simplicial-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-simplicial-set","status":"resolved","id":"43500a42511700ce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[14-df-simplicial-set]] 的单纯集合，$S_n=S([n])$。$n,i,j,k$ 均取外部自然数，$\\delta_i^n:[n-1]\\to[n]$、$\\sigma_i^n:[n+1]\\to[n]$ 以及 $d_i^n,s_i^n$ 在下式的明确指标域中定义；复合使用通常从右向左的次序。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S_n=S([n])","display":false},{"tex":"n,i,j,k","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_i^n:[n-1]\\to[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_i^n:[n+1]\\to[n]","display":false},{"tex":"d_i^n,s_i^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall i\\in[n]\\quad\n\\delta_i^n:=\\left([n-1],[n],\\left(k\\mapsto\\begin{cases}k&k<i,\\\\k+1&k\\ge i\\end{cases}\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall i\\in[n]\\quad\n\\sigma_i^n:=\\left([n+1],[n],\\left(k\\mapsto\\begin{cases}k&k\\le i,\\\\k-1&k>i\\end{cases}\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall i\\in[n]\\quad d_i^n:=S(\\delta_i^n):S_n\\to S_{n-1},\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall i\\in[n]\\quad s_i^n:=S(\\sigma_i^n):S_n\\to S_{n+1},\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\ \\forall i,j\\in[n]\\quad\ni<j\\Rightarrow d_i^{n-1}\\circ d_j^n=d_{j-1}^{n-1}\\circ d_i^n,\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall i,j\\in[n]\\quad\ni\\le j\\Rightarrow s_i^{n+1}\\circ s_j^n=s_{j+1}^{n+1}\\circ s_i^n,\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall j\\in[n]\\ \\forall i\\in[n+1]\\quad\ni<j\\Rightarrow d_i^{n+1}\\circ s_j^n=s_{j-1}^{n-1}\\circ d_i^n,\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall j\\in[n]\\quad\nd_j^{n+1}\\circ s_j^n=1_{S_n}=d_{j+1}^{n+1}\\circ s_j^n,\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\forall j\\in[n]\\ \\forall i\\in[n+1]\\quad\ni>j+1\\Rightarrow d_i^{n+1}\\circ s_j^n=s_j^{n-1}\\circ d_{i-1}^n.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta,\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":2485,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-311","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-simplicial-operators|df-221 — 面映射、退化映射与单纯恒等式]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-simplicial-operators]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-159","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-simplicial-operators]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-simplicial-operators]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-312","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-simplicial-operators|df-221 — 面映射、退化映射与单纯恒等式]]"}],"outgoing":["43500a42511700ce"]}